ve lost three great citizens yesterday  Heather hires funeral tomorrow we will  have to put to rest  trooper Burke Bates who had been part of  my executive protection detail and then  on Saturday lieutenant Jay Cullen who'd  been my pilot this breaks her heart you  have DeAndre Harris who was viciously  beaten by four or five individuals as I  said on Saturday let me be clear  hatred we got to address it these were  not Patriots these were cowards over my  shoulder as Barbara John's with 16 years  old led the revolt at Prince Edward  County Virginia when we had white  schools and black schools and she said  our schools are inferior and she led a  revolt a 400 student in the 50s that is  what we need is leader those are  patriots the men and women in uniform in  the president and I've talked to the  president let us use this time to bring  people together we are a United States  of America and the hatred that I saw on  Saturday  I'm telling Charlie I've never seen the  language and the things were said about  individuals members the african-american  community members with Jewish faith  members of the LGBT community there's no  place for it in Virginia I told him to  go home but let's be honest there's no  place in America for this type of hatred  so I've established a reconciliation  committee we're moving forward and to  see those people at University of  Virginia on the lawn yesterday that is  who Virginia is governor did you say  that you spoke with President Trump and  what did you tell him well when I talked  to him you know he called me right  before he gave his press conference I  said mr. president and I've been seeing  the the video all day this it's it's  hatred it's bigotry it's racism it needs  to stop in this country and I said  listen let us work together for  reconciliation let us go forward to  bring our nation back together again and  you know he agreed with me on the phone  call but but then governor after that  phone call he had that remarkable news  conference and when it was over you  issued a statement saying we need real  leadership in this country my state in  this country is still reeling from all  the hatred what does real leadership  look like to you in this case and do you  still want him to come back to  Charlottesville  that was not leadership what I saw and  as I went out and did it myself  represented not only Virginia but I  thought where America was those remarks  are dividing people we cannot be  dividing people people came and  protested the other day here in  Charlottesville one group came they came  heavily armed you saw the pictures of  individuals walking around with semi  autumn  rifles through our streets we knew the  FBI and the DHS has helped us with  intelligence we knew these folks were  coming armed and they wanted to harm  people on the other side were the folks  who were protesting hatred and bias and  bigotry they are two separate entirely  groups one was for uniting our country  the other side was to harm people do you  want him to come you would asked him to  come over the weekend do you still feel  that way listen if the president wants  to come to Charlottesville and address  our citizens talk about how we can heal  as a nation and how we meet need to move  before that is what the President of the  United States should do I do not want  the President to come here to continue  on with the speeches that he's given the  last couple days those speeches are  dividing us people now feel comfortable  nor that they can come into a city you  know they used to wear hoods now they  wear hoods and spew their hatred and  bigotry and bias there is no place for  that in this country and anyone who  incites that or encourages it allows  this type of behavior let me be clear  you have no place here in Virginia we do  not want you and I'll be honest with you  we don't want you here in America this  hate speech has got to end let us  continue to work together let's build a  great United States of America that's  who we are  governor McAuliffe thank you for joining  us for your first interview we  appreciate it
 

